ndered-xiejingren-near-family","chapter_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered:p002","quote":"景仁弟純字景懋，初為劉毅豫州別駕。毅鎮江陵，以為衞軍長史、南平相。王鎮惡率軍襲毅，已至城下，時毅疾病，佐吏皆入參承。純參承畢，已出，聞兵至，馳還入府。左右引車欲還外解，純叱之曰：「我人吏也，逃欲何之！」乃入。及毅兵敗眾散，時已暗夜，司馬毛脩之謂純曰：「君但隨僕。」純不從，扶兩人出，火光中為人所殺。純孫沈，太宗泰始初，為巴陵王休若衞軍錄事參軍、山陰令，坐事誅。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered:p002:m0016","object_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered:p002:m0015"}],"interpretation_note":"依本完整選段的原詞、本人及客體錨點保存；編者組裝另存，不補生母、無名父或未載排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"name_components":[{"id":"name-song052-shen","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_ABB*A","surname":"謝","ming":"沈","additional_names":[],"chapter_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered:p002","person_mention_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered:p002:m0016","source_anchor":{"chapter_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered:p002","mention_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered:p002:m0016","start":151,"end":152,"surface":"沈","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_ABB*A"},"quote":"景仁弟純字景懋，初為劉毅豫州別駕。毅鎮江陵，以為衞軍長史、南平相。王鎮惡率軍襲毅，已至城下，時毅疾病，佐吏皆入參承。純參承畢，已出，聞兵至，馳還入府。左右引車欲還外解，純叱之曰：「我人吏也，逃欲何之！」乃入。及毅兵敗眾散，時已暗夜，司馬毛脩之謂純曰：「君但隨僕。」純不從，扶兩人出，火光中為人所殺。純孫沈，太宗泰始初，為巴陵王休若衞軍錄事參軍、山陰令，坐事誅。","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"note":"本名及字依原句；部分省姓以具名近系／同段氏族語境復原，原文與原稱不改，不宣稱省姓處是完整姓名原字。","surname_basis":{"kind":"contextual_surname_from_source_bound_kinship_graph","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"rationale":"字面源姓與已保存的父系來源／有資格編者近系路徑；只復姓，不新建父子，不改原字、字號或排行。","frames":[{"native_path":"corpus/n